    "detailed_description": "Chibi Escape is an asymmetric multiplayer survival game, full of <i>action, team play, horror</i> and, of course, <i>fun</i>.<br><br>You wake up on an abandoned map in a company of few more unfortunate chibies like you. Scared, without any memories... Hopefully, you are not alone. Collaborate with others to find keys to open your way out.<br><br>- \u201cWait, did you hear that?\u201d<br>- \u201cWhy am I that scared?\u201d<br>- \u201dJesus Christ, he`s gonna kill us. RUN!\u201d<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912090/extras/eb450ec42b37c6ef6cb3f235d8330cf0.poster.avif?t=1729498990\" width=602 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912090/extras/eb450ec42b37c6ef6cb3f235d8330cf0.webm?t=1729498990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912090/extras/eb450ec42b37c6ef6cb3f235d8330cf0.mp4?t=1729498990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Nothing is that easy. Unfortunately, there is also a person, chosen by the curse. His main priority is to kill as much of you as he can, to fulfill Curse`s will.<br><br>Key features:<br>- <strong>Different in-game locations.</strong> Each round you will be spawned on one from a few different maps. The only similar goal is to find required amount of keys and escape the map through the gates\u2026 alive.<br>- <strong>Survive together \u2026 or not?</strong> You can collaborate with other survivors to escape all together. You can revive fallen Chibies, hinder killer from damaging survivors as a ghost. Or, you can betray your fallen teammates and escape alone\u2026 if you can.<br>- <strong>Fight for your survival or lose a part of your mind.</strong> Kill as many survivors as you can to prevent losing a piece of your consciousness, turning you into emotionless, empty chibi without any feeling or thoughts, knows as the Bots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912090/extras/9c04a94f7d6a376118a21703aa8948a1.poster.avif?t=1729498990\" width=602 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912090/extras/9c04a94f7d6a376118a21703aa8948a1.webm?t=1729498990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912090/extras/9c04a94f7d6a376118a21703aa8948a1.mp4?t=1729498990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Do whatever you can to survive, but remember. The main PRIORITY for your IS YOURSELF!",
