ionless, empty chibi without any feeling or thoughts, knows as the Bots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912090/extras/9c04a94f7d6a376118a21703aa8948a1.poster.avif?t=1729498990\" width=602 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912090/extras/9c04a94f7d6a376118a21703aa8948a1.webm?t=1729498990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912090/extras/9c04a94f7d6a376118a21703aa8948a1.mp4?t=1729498990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Do whatever you can to survive, but remember. The main PRIORITY for your IS YOURSELF!",
